{"4226570": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Lambslide", "steam_appid": 4226570, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A 1-4 player physics based sheep herding game set on one very large alpine mountain.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Call em in. Scare em off. Carry em over. Chase em down.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have no dog. But you have a hand puppet of one, and the sheep can't tell the difference. The flock is up there, it needs to be down here, and nobody is coming to help.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4226570/extras/56a921ddda929abea084e685ec465523.poster.avif?t=1787948687\" width=780 height=326 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4226570/extras/56a921ddda929abea084e685ec465523.webm?t=1787948687\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4226570/extras/56a921ddda929abea084e685ec465523.mp4?t=1787948687\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Protect your sheep<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4226570/extras/a7de1a9b9b7cbf5fb1f35c51e2692618.poster.avif?t=1787948687\" width=780 height=326 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4226570/extras/a7de1a9b9b7cbf5fb1f35c51e2692618.webm?t=1787948687\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4226570/extras/a7de1a9b9b7cbf5fb1f35c51e2692618.mp4?t=1787948687\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take Care of your sheep. 🐑</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4226570/extras/a1f0d3acc39569cddbfaa81925ce4c72.poster.avif?t=1787948687\" width=780 height=326 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4226570/extras/a1f0d3acc39569cddbfaa81925ce4c72.webm?t=1787948687\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4226570/extras/a1f0d3acc39569cddbfaa81925ce4c72.mp4?t=1787948687\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Love your sheep ♡♡♡♡</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4226570/extras/81e655a117705fd6e84d247df6f40d45.poster.avif?t=1787948687\" width=780 height=326 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4226570/extras/81e655a117705fd6e84d247df6f40d45.webm?t=1787948687\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4226570/extras/81e655a117705fd6e84d247df6f40d45.mp4?t=1787948687\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get them to the bottom of the mountain.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4226570/extras/86dc81124d415df45e9c94cf7332be97.poster.avif?t=1787948687\" width=780 height=326 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4226570/extras/86dc81124d415df45e9c94cf7332be97.webm?t=1787948687\" type=\"video/web